  "description": "A world where time loops every year.\n\nWhether she gets married or becomes rich, after a year, everything resets. Aileen, who has possessed the body of a romance novel character, sets out to find the original female lead, Delia, in order to stop the 100th time loop. Ever since she was possessed, Aileen had always wondered about one thing: why Delia, the “perfect heroine,” had become a hikikomori. Believing that the changed Delia is the cause of the time loop, Aileen tries to marry her off to the male lead, Bennett, just like in the original story...\n\nBut it turns out Bennett is actually “Aileen’s ex-boyfriend” who has been possessed? Will Aileen be able to marry the two of them off and break free from the time loop?\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
